city", "summary": "Slimecity is a colorful swarm-control roguelite about leading a cheerful little slime family through a bright, bouncy world.\n\nStart each run with a tiny group of adorable slimes and guide them around the city with your cursor. Your slimes wiggle, wobble, and work together as a growing swarm, collecting goobies, exploring new areas, overrunning buildings, and bumping into silly enemies along the way.\n\nBetween runs, return to your cozy cave to bank your resources and unlock permanent upgrades. Grow your slime group from a few tiny blobs into a big, playful crowd. Upgrade your starting slime count, carrying capacity, vision, influence range, speed, health, damage, and more through a visual underground skill tree.\n\nEach run lets you push a little farther, discover new enemy spots, collect more resources, and make your slime swarm even cuter, stronger, and more chaotic.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/slimecity", "videos": [{"id": 190905, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "-ZdAdZ6EWxI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-ZdAdZ6EWxI", "title": "Slimecity Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-ZdAdZ6EWxI/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}